obs the root is that a commit blob named ONE weave for a whole directory, so cmd_add loaded that weave and diffed the next file against the file before it, deleting the earlier one's every line
obs the .brix add-all route is the tool's own advertised way to track a project of more than one source, and it fired the fault on every run while printing wove 2/2 file(s) over it
obs six weave witnesses and yesterday's CLI-record guard all stood GREEN, because every one proves a record's SHAPE and none of them had ever added a second file
